        ("Follow up and learn", "Send a concise thank-you when appropriate, referring to a meaningful part of the discussion and reiterating relevant interest. Complete requested tasks on time and clarify scope before investing extensive unpaid effort. Record questions, strong answers, weak moments, and new information while memory is fresh. Do not interpret a delay as a verdict; continue other applications and follow the employer's stated timeline before checking in."),
