        ("Group skills for scanning", "Small groups such as Languages, Data, Design, Delivery, or Customer Operations make a long list easier to scan. Use familiar names and include a platform's full name when it reduces ambiguity. Avoid rating bars and unsupported proficiency labels."),
        ("Support every important skill", "The strongest skills also appear in dated work, projects, education, or certifications. A brief achievement shows how a capability was used and what changed. If a skill is new, present relevant coursework or a personal project with honest scope."),
